{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想把相片中的路人、電線或雜物一鍵清除，或快速去背製作商品圖與社群貼圖，Ai Photo 都可以在手機上離線完成。程式原價 US $39.99，現正推出終生版限時免費，適合經常修圖的創作者、網店賣家與日常隨手拍攝的用戶。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-155.webp\">\n<h2>離線 AI 去背與物件移除</h2>\n<p>程式全程以裝置端 AI 運算，相片不會上傳，亦不會損失畫質與 EXIF 資料。以指尖塗抹即可移除電線、路人、招牌、雜物、痘痘與皺紋，邊緣辨識後自然融合。智能去背適合人像、產品與社群貼圖。去背後可加描邊、陰影，或換成純色、漸變與自選背景，另支援雙重曝光與色彩分離效果。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-276-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-277-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-278-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-279-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-280-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-281-scaled.jpg\">\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Ai Photo – Background Eraser 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Ai Photo – Background Eraser</li>\n<li>應用類別：Graphics &amp; Design</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:38.609197+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":449,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T20:20:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T10:37:36.435412+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:14.495303+00:00","content_hash":"7d65a5522420f40322c5b6e7396642f7f2daeea508b6374c64965a59c2fd9fec","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}